                <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend:\n1) Client → Nginx (80/443)\n2) TLS termination at Nginx\n3) Routing by host/path to service\n4) Connect over internal bridge (proxy_net)\n5) Service response → client" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fillColor=#2b2b2b;align=left;fontColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
